        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "verse",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "天冲家计值空亡，跏跛风声病又加，惟有没神多债负，田园卖尽少荣华。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "uncertainty": []
      },
      {
        "id": "book001-b000593-p000-4702f5cf30",
        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "verse",
